// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig and fill in. That file is gitignored; this one is documentation.
//
// Quokka runs with none of these set. Thumbnails come from public oEmbed and CDN endpoints,
// and with no worker host the app falls back to ResolverConfig.failClosed -- rung 0 only,
// which is the on-device transcription of a file the user shared. That is a working app.
//
// Host only, no scheme. A `//` in an xcconfig starts a comment, so writing the full URL here
// would silently truncate it to `https:` and the failure would look like a dead worker.
//
// QUOKKA_WORKER_HOST = quokka.your-subdomain.workers.dev
